  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "review-109d9e5309ea-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC2",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "[P2] QA drift 未覆盖 branch delta 中的删除路径。qa.ts:89–93 将 deleted.txt 交给 inScopeTrackedDrift，但 workspace_scope.ts:1098–1100 仅遍历 frozen tree 与当前 index 中存在的路径；已提交的删除在两处都不存在，重新创建该文件不会被检查。应显式检查交付路径的预期缺失状态，并在 tests/batch-scope-estimate.test.ts 增加重新创建已删除文件时 QA 拒绝的测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:50e98bfba7f139b6d47bb0b80607ea254d23e5d56d04d307562d598ea757a445",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "Lane 提交删除 scope_hint 之外的 deleted.txt，QA prepare 重新创建该文件 → deleted.txt 虽在 changed_paths 中，却既不在 frozen tree 中，也不在当前 index 中，clean() 返回无 drift，后续 acceptance 可使用交付物中不存在的文件执行并通过；若检查结束时删除该临时文件，最终交付 identity 也保持不变。这违反完整 branch-delta drift 覆盖不变量。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/qa.ts:runDeterministicQa",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/workspace_scope.ts:inScopeTrackedDrift"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "AC2"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-1716067dc892-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "[P1] Lane 提交中断后无法恢复：plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:529 在移动 HEAD 前写入 production evidence，但 lookupBatchCommit 在 :857 要求该提交已经可从 HEAD 到达。应记录预期的旧 Lane HEAD，并在核对交付、audit 和 lineage 后安全完成尚未执行的 ref 更新；补充 evidence 写入后、ref 更新前中断的恢复测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:84cfe4be3deedb97e2f29bfd6a8bdc7f19c523417e3d6bd4555917cb0f032a9d",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "已通过 QA 并 settled 的 Lane 在 commitBatchChild 写入新提交 C 的 durable evidence 后、update-ref HEAD 前中断；HEAD 仍为原实现提交 H（仅 staged 的情况则仍为 base B），而 C 是以 B 为 parent 的新提交 → 重启后 lookupBatchCommit 读取 C，却因 C 不是当前 HEAD 的祖先而抛出 batch_head_lineage_broken；batch_lanes 将整个 batch 标记 failed，已审查的 beyond-estimate 交付无法继续集成。现有测试只在 commitBatchChild 完整返回后调用 lookup，未覆盖此中断窗口。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_lanes.ts:1229-1249",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:commitBatchChild",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:writeBatchCommitEvidence",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:lookupBatchCommit"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "AC1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
